cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Curonian Lagoon SFINCS model: Storm Xaver 2013 hindcast"
abstract: >-
  A whole-lagoon compound-flood model of the Curonian Lagoon (Lithuania) built
  with HydroMT-SFINCS and run on a Linux build of SFINCS v2.4.0, together with
  the reproducible preparation, build and validation pipeline. The first
  hindcast covers Storm Xaver, 28 November - 11 December 2013, validated against
  four water-level gauges in three forcing variants.
authors:
